    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ K-IG 교육- 153 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(Why Do I Admire Him?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "In spite of the lack of confidence in him by many Korean people,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "he never lost his confidence."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "He always emphasized that in order to be good players,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "they must start from the basics."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "By working hard and sticking to his plan"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "he was able to bring the Korean team"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "to the semi-finals during the 2002 World Cup."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "In short, Coach Hiddink proved that he could succeed"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "despite Korea’s lack of confidence in his abilities."
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        "1 번",
        "2 번",
        "3 번",
        "4 번",
        "5 번"
      ]
